<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">broadcast</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">broadcast</ansi> command is another name for
<ansi fg="command">chat</ansi>: it talks on the world-wide <ansi fg="cyan">chat</ansi> channel, and
everyone online who has the channel on will hear you.

You can also use <ansi fg="command">`</ansi> as a shortcut.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">broadcast hi everyone</ansi>
  <ansi fg="command">` hi everyone</ansi>

  Output to everyone with chat on:

  <ansi fg="cyan">(chat)</ansi> Charles: hi everyone

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help chat</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help channels</ansi>
